@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC-07 - View Session History

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "Desktop UI" as UI
participant "HistoryController" as Controller
participant "QuerySessionHistoryUseCase" as UseCase
participant "SessionHistoryQueryRepository" as Repo
database "Local database" as DB

Learner -> UI : open History and choose range/filter
UI -> Controller : GET /api/v1/sessions?from=...&to=...&status=...&page=0&size=20
Controller -> UseCase : query(SessionHistoryQuery)
UseCase -> UseCase : validate dates, status and pagination
UseCase -> Repo : findHistoryPage(query)
Repo -> DB : select fields from terminal focus_session rows\n(without interval collection)
DB --> Repo : page and total count
Repo --> UseCase : SessionHistoryPage
UseCase --> Controller : SessionHistoryPage
Controller --> UI : 200 OK\n{items, total, page, size}

note over Repo
  Read-only query. Uses a projection so the
  history screen does not load full aggregates
  or their interval collections.
end note

note over UI
  Default range: 7 days; other choices are 30 days
  and all time. Completed and abandoned sessions
  are included by default; results are newest first.
end note

@enduml
